Hyperreal helpers use u32 degrees and do not accept DyadicBudget. Hypersolve is a downstream consumer. The new helper remains in the dyadic owner, with arbitrary degree and shared deterministic reservations. Existing sqrt and integer-power call order/accounting are unchanged.
